====Verb====
{{en-verb|gas<:~es>}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[attack]] or [[kill]] with [[poison gas]].
#: {{ux|en|The Nazis '''gassed''' millions of Jews during the Holocaust.}}
#: {{ux|en|He never fully recovered after he was '''gassed''' on the Western Front.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To use [[poison gas]] in (a volume or area) to [[attack]] or [[kill]] someone or something.
#* {{quote-web|en|author=HarryBlank|work=w:SCP Foundation|title=Face Time|date=14 October 2023|url=https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/36-face-time|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20240523092945/https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/36-face-time|archivedate=23 May 2024|accessdate=18 June 2024|text="He's been waiting to jump my brain-bones since I left R&E. I could feel him hammering on the door." She trotted to the nearest wall and knocked on it for emphasis. "But whatever it is that makes us remember the good old days, it also makes us impossible to possess now. That's why Willie and I both woke up, and why Noè never got taken out by Mukami. So all I had to do was open my mind up to the guy, invite him in, then... '''gas''' the foyer, as it were."}}
# {{lb|en|intransitive|slang}} To [[talk]] in a [[boastful]] or [[vapid]] way; to [[chatter]].
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1899|author=w:Stephen Crane
|title=s:Twelve O'Clock|chapter=1
|passage={{...}} (it was the town's humour to be always '''gassing''' of phantom investors who were likely to come any moment and pay a thousand prices for everything) &mdash; “{{...}} Them rich fellers, they don't make no bad breaks with their money. {{...}}”}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1955|author=w:C. S. Lewis|title=w:The Magician's Nephew|publisher=Collins|year_published=1998|chapter=3
|passage="Well don't keep on '''gassing''' about it," said Digory.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive|slang}} To [[impose]] upon by [[talk]]ing [[boastfully]].
#* {{quote-song|en|date=2018-09-14|artist=w:Dizzy Rascal|album=Don't '''Gas''' Me|track=1|title=Don't '''Gas''' Me|url=https://genius.com/Dizzee-rascal-dont-gas-me-lyrics|passage=I went shop and the boss man said "Don't pay me it's fine" and I said ...(whaaat): "You ain't gotta '''gas''', I'm gas fam" ( don't '''gas''' me), "You ain't gotta '''gas''', I'm gas fam".}}
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To [[emit]] [[#Noun|gas]].
#: {{ux|en|The battery cell was '''gassing'''.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[impregnate]] with [[#Noun|gas]].
#: {{ux|en|to '''gas''' lime with chlorine in the manufacture of bleaching powder}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[singe]], as in a [[#Noun|gas]] [[flame]], so as to [[remove]] [[loose]] [[fiber]]s.
#: {{ux|en|to '''gas''' thread}}

